    "languages": [],
    "summaryAr": "Ready to own it, build it, and grow it? The Mission: Publitas lets people, and increasingly agents, create, host and distribute digital flyers and catalogues for retail brands. Our customers include ALDI, IKEA, Carrefour, Metro and Decathlon. Right now we’re building a fully automatic, agentic workflow that generates a whole catalogue from a brand guide and a list of products. As a Staff Product Engineer, you’ll buil",
    "descriptionAr": "Ready to own it, build it, and grow it? The Mission: Publitas lets people, and increasingly agents, create, host and distribute digital flyers and catalogues for retail brands. Our customers include ALDI, IKEA, Carrefour, Metro and Decathlon. Right now we’re building a fully automatic, agentic workflow that generates a whole catalogue from a brand guide and a list of products. As a Staff Product Engineer, you’ll build this product hands-on, taking open-ended problems to working software in whatever part of the stack the problem needs. You’ll join a team of senior engineers who are put on our hardest problems, some of which cut across teams. Our customer base is large (not Google scale, but big), so what you ship gets used, and it comes with real technical challenges. Our core stack is Ruby on Rails on the backend and JavaScript with React on the frontend, with services around it in JavaScript, TypeScript and Python. This is a staff-level role, and you’ll have a lot of influence in a mid-sized company with very little red tape. This role is for you if You've built several complete products and you'd enjoy showing them to us. You like open-ended problems, and you'd rather work out what to build than be handed a spec. You enjoy problems that are hard to think through, and you can point to one you cracked. You get excited about the end result, not just the code. AI has changed what you dare to build: you ship faster, and you take on projects you’d never have started alone. You want real influence in a mid-sized company with a large customer base and very little red tape. It's probably not for you if You prefer to stay in one layer of the stack. You want a detailed spec or a clear list of tasks before you start. You're still trying AI out rather than building with it every day. Where and when you work The role is fully remote, and most of the stakeholders and peers work Central European hours. Nobody sets your schedule, but we'd like around six hours of overlap with the team on a normal day. In practice that works best if you live within about two hours of CET. Show us what you've built When you apply, point us to things you've made. Complete, working applications say the most, but libraries and tools are welcome too. We'd love to hear how you built them. What We Offer You to Win Transparent Compensation : A competitive salary (geo-bracketed to your location in the EU) with a clear, performance-based path for career progression. True Remote Autonomy : No clock-watching or useless alignment meetings. You manage your territory as if it were your own business. Global Team Retreats : Working remotely shouldn't mean working isolated. We gather the entire company in inspiring cities across the globe once a year to connect, strategize, and celebrate in person. Modern Sales Stack & Gear : A premium MacBook, remote work accessories, and a co-working budget if you want to work outside your home. Personal Growth Budget : A monthly wellness allowance, an education/course budget to sharpen your skills, and free access to Kindle and Audible books. Time Off : 25 days of paid vacation plus your local national holidays. At Publitas, we see AI as a core lever for performance, efficiency, and innovation. We expect all team members to actively use AI in their daily work to improve quality, speed, and output. Depending on the role, this ranges from effectively using AI tools in day-to-day workflows to designing and scaling AI-driven systems. We are not looking for candidates who are “AI-curious”; we look for people who already use AI to do better work and can demonstrate tangible impact. Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow",
