    "languages": [],
    "summaryAr": "About the Team OpenAI Finance is responsible for ensuring the organization is set up for success in pursuit of its mission. The Treasury team is responsible for protecting liquidity, enabling scale, maintaining strong controls, and helping the company operate with clarity and resilience. We work across finance and operational partners to ensure funds move safely, visibility remains high, and Treasury infrastructure k",
    "descriptionAr": "About the Team OpenAI Finance is responsible for ensuring the organization is set up for success in pursuit of its mission. The Treasury team is responsible for protecting liquidity, enabling scale, maintaining strong controls, and helping the company operate with clarity and resilience. We work across finance and operational partners to ensure funds move safely, visibility remains high, and Treasury infrastructure keeps pace with a fast-moving business. As hands-on operators and builders, we combine financial judgment with AI, automation, and data to solve problems faster, strengthen controls, and continuously improve how Treasury operates. About the Role We are looking for a senior hire to help structure financing for major deals, improve working capital, and lead cash forecasting and liquidity planning. Reporting to the Treasurer, you’ll partner with Compute and teams across OpenAI to design creative financing and payment solutions that support the company’s growth. AI and automation will be core to how you build and scale this capability. This role can be based in San Francisco, CA, Seattle, WA, or New York, NY. We use a hybrid work model of 3 days in the office per week and offer relocation assistance to new employees. In this role, you will: Structure and negotiate trade finance solutions that improve deal economics and manage risk. Improve cash conversion by working with Billing, Collections, Accounting, and business teams to bill sooner, collect faster, improve supplier terms, and reduce unnecessary deposits or inventory commitments. Free up cash and credit capacity by managing collateral, letters of credit, guarantees, and renewals. Build direct cash forecasts by incorporating business-specific receipts and payments, compute commitments, and financing timing. Partner with Treasury’s Investment team to determine liquidity buffers, investment decisions, and contingency funding plans. Advise on deal structuring Compute, Finance, and Legal, then coordinate execution with Treasury Operations. Improve e-commerce payment economics with Product, Payments, and Strategic Finance, balancing cost, acceptance, risk, and settlement timing. Recommend billing, collection, prepayment, and credit terms for new business models, balancing cash protection with ease of purchase. Use AI and automation to streamline contract review, credit support tracking, cash forecasting, and treasury workflows. You might thrive in this role if you have: 10+ years of progressive experience in corporate treasury or banking, including trade finance structuring, working capital management, and cash flow forecasting. A strong track record of negotiating and implementing complex trade finance across multiple instruments. Experience delivering measurable cash conversion improvements through billing, collections, supplier terms, or inventory. Sound judgment on contracts, risk, and approvals, and the ability to explain trade-offs to senior leaders and align business, finance, and legal teams. Built direct cash flow forecasts and reconciled them to an indirect forecast or cash flow statement, with a strong grasp of how commercial terms and balance sheet changes affect liquidity. Leveraged AI or automation to improve finance workflows end-to-end. Experience in infrastructure, hardware, or other capital-intensive businesses, or familiarity with global e-commerce payments (preferred but not required). About OpenAI OpenAI is an AI research and deployment company dedicated to ensuring that general-purpose artificial intelligence benefits all of humanity. We push the boundaries of the capabilities of AI systems and seek to safely deploy them to the world through our products. AI is an extremely powerful tool that must be created with safety and human needs at its core, and to achieve our mission, we must encompass and value the many different perspectives, voices, and experiences that form the full spectrum of humanity. We are an equal opportunity employer, and we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability, genetic information, or other applicable legally protected characteristic. For additional information, please see OpenAI’s Affirmative Action and Equal Employment Opportunity Policy Statement . Background checks for applicants will be administered in accordance with applicable law, and qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment consistent with those laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act, for US-based candidates. For unincorporated Los Angeles County workers: we reasonably believe that criminal history may have a direct, adverse and negative relationship with the following job duties, potentially resulting in the withdrawal of a conditional offer of employment: protect computer hardware entrusted to you from theft, loss or damage; return all computer hardware in your possession (including the data contained therein) upon termination of employment or end of assignment; and maintain the confidentiality of proprietary, confidential, and non-public information. In addition, job duties require access to secure and protected information technology systems and related data security obligations. To notify OpenAI that you believe this job posting is non-compliant, please submit a report through this form . No response will be provided to inquiries unrelated to job posting compliance. We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with disabilities, and requests can be made via this link . OpenAI Global Applicant Privacy Policy At OpenAI, we believe artificial intelligence has the potential to help people solve immense global challenges, and we want the upside of AI to be widely shared. Join us in shaping the future of technology.",
